# Never commit RAUC signing material or server secrets. The CA key, the bundle
# signing key, the hawkBit admin password and the gateway token all live OUTSIDE
# this repo (rockchip/secrets/, see README "Secrets you must carry").
# Only the CA *certificate* is tracked -- it is public by design.
*.key.pem
*.key
*.env
.env
!.env.example
!recipes-core/rauc/files/ipool-ca.cert.pem
